#. ところで、苗木君。
#. あなたはマージャンはお好きですか？
msgctxt "0001 | CELES"
msgid "Say, Makoto...do you like mahjong?"
msgstr ""

#. ううん…やった事ないけど…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Umm...I've never actually played."
msgstr ""

#. そうですか。残念ですわ…
#. せっかくですから、ご一緒にと思ったのですが…
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Is that so? A pity. I was hoping we might play\n"
"together."
msgstr ""

#. …セレスさんは、得意なの？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you good at it?"
msgstr ""

#. いえ、得意って程でもありませんが…
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid "Good? No, I am not merely good."
msgstr ""

#. 以前、<CLT 3>命がけの勝負<CLT>を行い、
#. それに勝った事ならありますわよ。
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I once played a game of <CLT 3>Russian roulette mahjong<CLT> and\n"
"won."
msgstr ""

#. 命がけ…？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Russian roulette...?"
msgstr ""

#. 頭のおかしい金持ちの老人宅で行われた、
#. 壮絶な勝負でしたわ…
msgctxt "0008 | CELES"
msgid ""
"It was a truly fierce contest, put on by a half-insane\n"
"billionaire in the basement of his mansion."
msgstr ""

#. “剛運”を持つ老人と、
#. “悪魔”と呼ばれる銀髪の少年が相手でしたわね。
msgctxt "0009 | CELES"
msgid ""
"My opponents were a fierce old man and a silver-haired\n"
"boy who was said to have the devil's own luck."
msgstr ""

#. ルール自体も変わってて、
#. なんだかガラスの牌を使ったような思い出が…
msgctxt "0010 | CELES"
msgid ""
"We played with a modified rule set. I remember well\n"
"the glass tiles we used..."
msgstr ""

#. …それに勝ったの？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And you won...?"
msgstr ""

#. ぐにょ～と歪ませてやりましたわ。
#. ２人いっぺんにね。
msgctxt "0012 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I defeated them both at once. I will never forget the\n"
"angry, twisted looks on their faces."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしが勝つのが意外だったらしく、
#. 周囲もザワ…ザワ…としておりましたわね。
msgctxt "0013 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The crowd that been invited to watch became positively\n"
"riotous. Nobody could believe I had won."
msgstr ""

#. うふふ、いい思い出ですわ…
msgctxt "0014 | CELES"
msgid "Hmhmhm. That is one of my fonder memories..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>セレスさんとのマージャン…
#. ご一緒しないで本当に良かった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm really glad I didn't agree to play mahjong with\n"
"her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>セレスの<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Celeste's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>セレスさんの壮絶な過去にめまいを覚えつつ、
#. ボクは自分の部屋へと戻っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Unable to comprehend Celeste's fearsome past, I went\n"
"back to my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
